   "review_stars": 5.0,
   "review_date": "2022-01-09 19:18:59",
   "review_text": "What a great brunch. A couple days ago my wife randomly decided she'd book a hotel in Santa Barbara for the weekend. She said she had already found a good spot for brunch Sunday morning. Usually I plan all the trips so she had a lot of pressure not to disappoint. And... she did not. Moral of the story: here we are now, just enjoyed a delicious breakfast burrito (her) and steak/eggs/frites (me). Most importantly the \"mimosa madness\" was served just the way I like it, just a splash of juice. This may have influenced this review :)\nOur server Jamie was awesome and very hospitable. 5 stars for food, ambiance, and service. We'll be back some day."
  },

{
